      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もしかして、\r\n天を統べる幻獣のところに行きたいのか？",
        "official_en": "Let me guess. You’re ready to go see the so-called Esper Lord of the Heavens?",
        "real_en": "You want to go see the Eidolon who rules the heavens?"
      },
      "review": {
